{"unit_id":"zhangweiii__dsh-tui#card-zh","repo":"zhangweiii/dsh-tui","commit":"0dbc51844363d06a935e1947990dda451f6a33a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH TUI 是 DeepSeek Harness 的交互式终端客户端，通过 Cordis profile bundle 挂载终端应用，可连接共享 Web Host 或使用进程内 Host。它支持创建、搜索、恢复和分叉持久化会话，切换模型、提供方、preset 与权限模式，并通过命令管理工作区、设置、图片和会话导出。界面提供键盘驱动的命令补全、选择面板、历史浏览和实时会话状态。适合希望在命令行中使用 DSH 并与 Web 会话共享状态的用户；需要兼容 DSH Host 和交互式终端，不要求插件单独配置 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/app.ts:39-103","src/controller.ts:332-380","src/commands.ts:18-94"]}
{"unit_id":"zhangweiii__dsh-tui#card-en","repo":"zhangweiii/dsh-tui","commit":"0dbc51844363d06a935e1947990dda451f6a33a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH TUI is an interactive terminal client for DeepSeek Harness. It connects to a Web Host or uses an in-process Host. Users can create, search, resume, and fork sessions, select models and presets, and manage workspaces with commands. It requires a compatible Host and interactive terminal.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/app.ts:39-103","src/controller.ts:332-380","src/commands.ts:18-94"]}
